6:["$","$Lf",null,{"children":["$","$L10",null,{"caseStudy":{"slug":"aurora-goods","title":"Aurora Goods: +34% conversion in 8 weeks","clientLogo":"/images/casestudy-aurora-logo.png","clientName":"Aurora Goods","metrics":[{"label":"Conversion rate","value":"+34%"},{"label":"Page speed","value":"3.2s → 1.1s"},{"label":"Color-related returns","value":"-98%"},{"label":"SKUs optimized","value":"500"}],"ctaSticky":"Get results like this","snapshot":{"client":"Aurora Goods","industry":"D2C Skincare","services":["E-commerce Catalog Optimization","Color Standardization Protocol"],"timeline":"8 weeks · 2025"},"serviceSlug":"ecommerce","challengeTitle":"A catalog that was actively losing revenue","challengeText":["Aurora Goods had grown from 50 to 500 SKUs in two years, but their catalog hadn't grown with them. Every product had been photographed by a different freelancer, in different lighting, on different backgrounds. The result looked like a marketplace, not a brand.","Their conversion rate had been declining for 6 months despite increasing ad spend. Customer service was fielding daily complaints about products not matching photos. Returns were up 22% year-over-year, with 'color mismatch' cited in 60% of cases.","The team knew the catalog was the problem, but rebuilding 500 SKUs felt impossible. They'd been putting it off for a year."],"challengeImage":"/images/casestudy-aurora-challenge.jpg","approachTitle":"System first, scale second","approachText":["We started with a 1-week audit of the top 50 SKUs — analyzing photography style, copy structure, page speed, and conversion data. The audit revealed that inconsistency, not quality, was the core issue. The photos weren't bad; they were just from 12 different photographers.","We designed a single style guide — locked lighting, consistent angles, standardized retouching — and built a retouching pipeline that could handle 50 SKUs per week. Every product would be re-photographed on white, lifestyle, and detail angles.","The key decision was to build the system before touching a single product. By week 2, the pipeline was ready. By week 8, all 500 SKUs were live."],"approachImage":"/images/casestudy-aurora-approach.jpg","shippedTitle":"What we shipped","shippedIntro":"A complete catalog system — photography, copy, architecture, and a reusable style guide the team can follow for every future product.","shipItems":[{"title":"500 SKUs re-photographed","desc":"White background, lifestyle, and detail shots — all to a single locked style guide.","image":"/images/casestudy-aurora-ship-1.jpg"},{"title":"Listing copy rewritten","desc":"Titles, bullets, and descriptions optimized for search and conversion across Amazon, Shopify, and DTC.","image":"/images/casestudy-aurora-ship-2.jpg"},{"title":"Catalog architecture + PIM","desc":"Category structure, navigation, and a PIM system as a single source of truth for every asset.","image":"/images/casestudy-aurora-ship-3.jpg"}],"liveProjectUrl":"https://auroragoods.example.com","resultsTitle":"The numbers, before and after","resultsMetrics":[{"label":"Conversion rate","value":"1.8% → 2.4%"},{"label":"Page load time","value":"3.2s → 1.1s"},{"label":"Color returns","value":"22% → 0.4%"},{"label":"Ad ROAS","value":"2.1x → 3.4x"}],"resultsImage":"/images/casestudy-aurora-results.jpg","testimonial":{"quote":"They rebuilt our entire catalog in 8 weeks. Within two months our conversion rate was up 34% and our ad spend was working harder than ever. The system they built is still running — we haven't needed a photographer since.","name":"Maria Chen","role":"Head of E-commerce, Aurora Goods"},"learningsTitle":"What we'd repeat or change","learningsText":["We'd repeat the system-first approach — building the pipeline before shooting a single product saved weeks. The style guide is now the single most valuable asset Aurora owns.","We'd change the copywriting timeline. We wrote listing copy in parallel with photography, but the copy team needed the final retouched images to reference. Next time, we'd sequence copy after retouching."],"servicesUsed":["E-commerce Catalog Optimization","Color Standardization Protocol"],"relatedTitle":"Related case studies","ctaTitle":"Want results like this?"}}]}]
